OL,3,GNEWSACyclist killed in collision was
OL,4,A'kindest person'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe husband of a cyclist who died
OL,7,Ffollowing a serious collision has paid
OL,8,Ftribute to the "endlessly caring"
OL,9,Fmother of two.
OL,11,FMichelle Tiller, 44, was riding a
OL,12,Fbicycle that collided with a black
OL,13,FVolvo V60 in Lindsay Avenue,
OL,14,FNorthampton at about 08:25 BST on 1
OL,15,FSeptember.
OL,17,FShe was taken to University Hospital
OL,18,FCoventry but died of her injuries on
OL,19,FThursday.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
