OL,3,GNEWSACyclist killed in collision was
OL,4,A'kindest person'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn 80-year-old man from Northampton has
OL,7,Fbeen arrested on suspicion of causing
OL,8,Fserious injury by careless driving and
OL,9,Freleased on police bail pending further
OL,10,Finvestigation.
